 * inside the GEMM kernel. They can be overridden at compile time, e.g.:
 *
 *   -DGEMM_BLOCK_J=128 -DGEMM_BLOCK_K=256
 *
 * so that the blocking can be tuned for a particular machine.
 * ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
